    "pipeline/build_database.py and are clearly marked as derived in the output.",
    "",
    "Only NON-ZERO changes are listed; the source pages contained no other rows for these weeks beyond",
    "those transcribed.",
    "",
    "SCOPE NOTE: these are the rows recovered during the initial build. The archived corpus covers",
    "seasons 2010-2025 across 10 position filters and 18+ weeks each; expanding coverage is tracked in",
    "RECOMMENDATIONS.md because each page fetch is a separate rate-limited request."
